An email management tool

A single-user application that connects to operator's email accounts and presents them through one unified interface, so that mail across several mailboxes can be read, searched, sorted and replied to in one place.

What it does
Reads and searches mail across multiple accounts at once
Sorts incoming mail into labels and folders
Reviews older mail and identifies what is no longer worth keeping
Drafts and sends replies at the operator's instruction
Who it is for
It is built and run by own mailboxes. It is not a commercial service, it is not offered to other users, and it has no sign-up.

Privacy
The application stores no copy of any mailbox and shares no data with third parties for commercial purposes. The full privacy policy sets out what it accesses, how credentials are stored, and how to revoke access.

